units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic

lattice fcc 1.0
region box block 0 5 0 5 0 5 units lattice
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box


pair_style zero 10.0
pair_coeff * *
mass 1 27

neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes

timestep 1.0
velocity all create 300.0 12345 mom yes rot no dist gaussian
fix 1 all npt temp 300.0 300.0 0.1 iso 1.01325 1.01325 1.0
run 10
